  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Our Heavyweight Top Load Canvas Duffle Bag is designed to take your adventures to the next level. Crafted with heavy-duty 22 oz canvas, this top-load duffel is super sturdy and reliable, providing large storage capacity for all your essential gear. Whether you&rsquo;re heading out for a short hike on the trail, a long weekend in the woods, or a multi-week cross-country adventure, our military duffle bag has you covered.</p>",
  "no_ratings": "0",
  "sort_order": "14161",
  "description": "<p>Our Heavyweight Top Load Canvas Duffle Bag is designed to take your adventures to the next level. Crafted with heavy-duty 22 oz canvas, this top-load duffel is super sturdy and reliable, providing large storage capacity for all your essential gear. Whether you&rsquo;re heading out for a short hike on the trail, a long weekend in the woods, or a multi-week cross-country adventure, our military duffle bag has you covered.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Top Grade Canvas:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Made from Rothco&rsquo;s durable heavyweight canvas fabric, this superior material is naturally water-resistant, rugged, and is built for the long haul. No one comes close to Rothco&rsquo;s collection of ultra-premium canvas bags and packs.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Fortified Flex Points:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The double reinforced grab handle is a signature feature of Rothco's collection of canvas bags, allowing you to carry heavy loads while minimizing wear and tear.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Sturdy Shoulder Strap:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>This heavy-duty duffle bag is equipped with a cotton web shoulder strap that&rsquo;s ideal for carrying your gear during extended travel.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Secure Storage:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Our top-loading design ensures your gear stays safe during any outdoor excursion or sports activity. Plus, our hook-and-eyelet closure can accommodate almost any padlock, ensuring your belongings will always stay secure.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Multiple Sizes Available:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Standard (260L) = 21 inch x 36 inch</li>\n<li>Jumbo (430L) = 25 inch x 42 inch</li>\n<li>Giant = (738L) = 30 inch x 50 inch</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Ultimate Versatility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The top-load Duffle is the ultimate outdoor companion for all your adventures. The bag&rsquo;s narrow shape makes it perfect for carrying your sporting and gym gear, and works great as a laundry bag!</li>\n</ul>",
